  "description": "<p>This inspirational faith floral area rug offers a blend of comfort and spiritual ambiance, featuring a beautiful design. Crafted for durability and ease of care, it enhances various home settings and church spaces. The rug can be personalized, making it a thoughtful gift or a unique decorative element.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features an inspirational faith floral design with personalized text options.</li>\n<li>Soft polyester fabric with anti-slip backing for comfort and safety.</li>\n<li>Wrinkle-resistant and fade-resistant for long-lasting appearance.</li>\n<li>Suitable for a variety of indoor spaces including bedrooms and living rooms.</li>\n<li>Enhances both spiritual and interior atmospheres.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form Type</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Entryways, Bedrooms, Living Rooms, Offices, Gamer Rooms, Reading Nooks, Church</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance Level</td>\n<td>Not Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Floral</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Faith, Christian</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Traditional</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Memory Foam, Polyester Fabric</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Cotton Blend, Anti-slip Backing</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Vacuum for quick cleaning, machine wash for deeper care</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Vacuuming, Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile rug is ideal for enhancing the decor of entryways, bedrooms, living rooms, offices, gamer rooms, and cozy reading nooks. It also serves as a suitable prayer rug or a decorative piece for church settings, fostering a spiritual and welcoming environment.</p>",
